  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PAJUST II - Transitional Justice 2015-2018 - PAJUST - Transitional Justice 2015-2018 (strategy 2016-2020)</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">PAJUST II - &#xd6;verg&#xe5;ngsr&#xe4;ttvisa 2015-2018</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PAJUST aims at strenthening transitional justice.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">PAJUST syftar till att bidra till &#xf6;verg&#xe5;ngsr&#xe4;ttvisa.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Guatemalan State applies integral mechanisms of transitional justice for victims of the internal armed conflict (IAC), in coordination with civil society and in accordance with the international framework for Human Rights. Victims of the IAC enjoy full exercise of the transitional justice rights and expand their means of life.</narrative>
  </description>
